/**
 * @mainpage Descent 3 Test Harness — Whole-Game-Linked Coverage
 *
 * @section overview Overview
 *
 * This build achieves **whole-game-linked coverage**: 2536 GoogleTest cases
 * covering all 112 `Descent3/*.cpp` modules plus the portable utility
 * libraries (`lib`, `fix`, `cfile`, `ddio`, `misc`, `md5`, `vecmat`,
 * `physics`). See `tests/CMakeLists.txt` for the per-module executable
 * matrix and `TESTING.md` for the CI workflow (`npm run tests`,
 * `npm run unit-tests`, `npm run render-tests`).
 *
 * @subsection added Added in commit 821b9cd — 187 squashed commits
 *
 * - **43 whole-game-linked suites** via the `descent3` static library with
 *   `LINKER:--wrap,_ZN5pilot10initializeEv` and a `Video_res_list` headless
 *   fixup (see `pilot::initialize` wrapping in `_linked_real_tests.cpp`
 *   harnesses).
 * - **112 per-module `*_real_tests.cpp` harnesses** (one per
 *   `Descent3/*.cpp`, keyed by `p.stem.lower()` in `tests/CMakeLists.txt`).
 * - **Utility coverage**: `lib`, `fix`, `vecmat`, `psclass`, `pstring`,
 *   `md5`, `ddio`, `misc`, `crossplat`, `IOOps`, `holder`, `byteswap`.
 * - Final batch (representative):
 *   `CtlCfgElem.cpp:479 cfg_binding_text`,
 *   `multi_dll_mgr.cpp:387 GetMultiAPI / 577 FreeMultiDLL`,
 *   `mission_download.cpp:626 ClipURLToWidth, 647 SecondsToString, 676 _get_zipfilename`,
 *   `multisafe_server.cpp:43 VerifyMSafeObject`,
 *   `OsirisLoadandBind.cpp:3934 (SOAR-disabled stubs)`,
 *   `soar_helpers.cpp:348`, `multi_client` timeout, `ctlconfig`, `controls`,
 *   `gauges`, `GameLoop`, etc.
 *
 * @subsection build Build & Run
 *
 * @code{.sh}
 * mkdir -p build && cd build
 * cmake .. -DCMAKE_CXX_COMPILER=clang++ -DBUILD_TESTING=ON
 * cmake --build . -j$(nproc)
 * npm run unit-tests -- --build-dir build --output-dir build/tests/unit_output  # no-build after first
 * npm run tests        # unit + render, artifacts under build/tests/
 * @endcode
 *
 * Artifacts:
 * - `build/tests/tests_report.html` (Unit + Render tabs)
 * - `build/tests/unit_output/unit_results.json`
 * - `build/tests/render_output/render_results.json` + PNGs/MD5s
 *
 * @section groups Test Groups
 *
 * All harnesses are tagged with `@ingroup descent3_tests` so Doxygen
 * groups them under this module:
 *
 * - @ref descent3_real_tests — isolated `*_real_tests.cpp` (one source file
 *   + stubbed dependencies, `RELEASE` suppresses `Int3()`).
 * - @ref descent3_linked_tests — whole-game-linked
 *   `*_linked_real_tests.cpp` (link `descent3` static, wrap
 *   `pilot::initialize`).
 * - @ref descent3_standalone_tests — portable header-only / utility tests
 *   (`*_tests_standalone.cpp`, `lib_util_tests`, `ddio_file_tests`, etc.).
 *
 * @section conventions Conventions
 *
 * - **File header**: `@file`, `@brief`, `@details`, `@par Source/Harness/Framework/Isolation|Linkage`,
 *   `@ingroup descent3_tests`, `@see Source.cpp`.
 * - **Test case**: `@test Suite.Case`, `@brief`, `@details`, `@see Source.cpp`,
 *   `@ingroup descent3_tests`.
 * - **Fixture**: `@brief GTest fixture for XTest`, `@details SetUp()` baseline.
 * - **Stubs**: file body documents the stub inventory (globals, `REPLACE` vs `WRAP`).
 * - **Quirks**: documented inline (`// quirk:`) and in `@details` when the
 *   harness preserves intentional divergence from the spec.
 *
 * @section headless Headless / CI
 *
 * `Video_res_list` headless fix + `pilot::initialize` wrapping allow the
 * linked suites to run without a display server or pilot files.
 * The render tests separately use `llvmpipe` via Mesa; see `TESTING.md`.
 *
 * @see TESTING.md
 * @see tests/CMakeLists.txt
 * @see Descent3/
 */
